title: "First-party service collision: builtin-calendar and builtin-guide-shell both override the global output_format service"
description: Bundled calendar and guide-shell both participate in output formatting. Treat command-bounded services and discriminated renderers as compatible scoped ownership while continuing to report genuinely unscoped global output collisions.
